'''Makuhita''' (Japanese: '''マクノシタ''' ''Makunoshita'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

